Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,H_en,,0,0,0,,"You're afraid she'll come back ALIVE."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.22,S_en,,0,0,0,,Shen Zhenzhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:03.61,S_en,,0,0,0,,Ever since the accident with Shen Nian,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.33,S_en,,0,0,0,,you've been scheming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.93,S_en,,0,0,0,,to stop everyone from searching for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.50,S_en,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:09.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:14.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,What are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,You're afraid she'll come back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.12,S_en,,0,0,0,,I've simply accepted reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.76,S_en,,0,0,0,,My sister is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.36,S_en,,0,0,0,,The sharks ate her long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.57,S_en,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.36,S_en,,0,0,0,,Then you'd better pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,That she's really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.50,S_en,,0,0,0,,Because she might just come back.
